{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":160,"mirrow":false,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1","addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":160,"mirrow":false,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1","addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]没问题的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎也总是替妈妈去驿站跑腿，目前路上的这些危险，缇莎已经可以自己应付了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]虽然妈妈一直在教缇莎战斗技巧……可是缇莎还是不太擅长控制力量。[r]每次使用魔法……都会消耗很多魔力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]所以每次缇莎出门之前，都要做好准备，带上好多药水！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]你说魔法药水也不便宜？但妈妈说这是缇莎成长需要的过程。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]“只有多用魔法，你才能慢慢掌握控制魔力的技巧。[r]如果舍不得药水，可能会发生更危险的事？”妈妈大概是这样说的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]缇莎也不知道为什么要这么说……妈妈只是说，如果积蓄太久魔力而不使用的话，缇莎会生病的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]所以说缇莎其实很厉害，只是……比喻的话，比较耗柴？[r]噗哈哈！的确是这样呢，可能缇莎就是很耗柴吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]不过，缇莎会努力的！缇莎一定会成为不需要妈妈和{myName}担心的大秘术师！[r]{myName}也可以多期待期待缇莎哦！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":160,"mirrow":false,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1","addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎-（来这边的路上安全吗？）","script":"sj_011_02"}